          "key": "description",
          "lead": [],
          "value": "\"Push delivery for incidents — turns a coalesced bsc-incident Incident into a phone notification. ntfy first: a self-hosted push server, so a POST from here becomes a real OS notification on a phone whose app is closed, with no Apple/Google account and nothing leaving your own infrastructure. The Incident→message mapping is pure and tested; the POST sits behind a transport trait.\""
